// The default deck.
//
// Fields
//   id     unique and stable (history and on/off switches refer to it)
//   diff   1 Easy (10 pts) · 2 Medium (20) · 3 Hard (35) · 4 Epic (50)
//   mins   rough duration in minutes
//   who    solo (player on turn) · duo (pick a partner) · group (everyone) · versus (pick a winner)
//   tags   strangers physical creative food drinks culture photo explore silly water transit chill indoor
//   tool   optional built-in tool: timer (+ secs) stopwatch photo bingo station compass tarot song topic letter coin dice picker
//   place  optional id from places.js. The card is only dealt when you are within range, and is worth +10.
//   needs  optional: only deal the card when all of these hold right now
//          summer (May–Sep) · winter (Nov–Mar) · xmas (15 Nov–Dec) · daylight · dark ·
//          daytime (10–17, opening hours) · dry (not raining) · rain (raining)
//          While it rains, cards tagged indoor are dealt twice as often.
//
// Drinks cards always allow a non-alcoholic version. Water cards only at official, safe spots.

